    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you explain why you think the enforcement-heavy approach is less effective for economic needs? Some analysts argue that without strict security and controlled entry, the social infrastructure and labor markets end up overwhelmed, which could actually cause more instability in the long run.",
